---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';import {withBase} from '../lib/base';
const tools=[['link-library','Link Library','Give useful pages a home. Save a title, address, tag and the reason you want to come back. Search your collection, then export it.','Title · Address · Tag · Note','bookmarks'],['decision-workbench','Decision Workbench','Compare three options against three criteria. Change your weights and see how quickly the result moves. A worksheet for thinking, not an authority.','Three options × Three criteria','decisions'],['one-page-week','One-page Week','Put three priorities and seven days on one readable surface. Print it, change it, start again.','Three priorities. Seven days.','week']];
---
<Base title="The workshop"><div class="wrap"><header class="page-head"><h1>Useful. Small.<br/>Yours to keep.</h1><p>Three browser tools from Issue 001. Use them here, or download a single HTML file to keep and adapt. No installation or account required.</p></header>{tools.map(([slug,title,desc,sample,article])=><section class="tool-landing"><div><h2><a class="story-title" href={withBase('/tools/'+slug+'/')}>{title}</a></h2><a class="button" href={withBase('/tools/'+slug+'/')}>Open the tool <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><div><p>{desc}</p><p><a href={withBase('/'+article+'/')}>Read the companion guide →</a></p><div class="tool-visual"><small>What you work with</small><span>{sample}</span></div></div></section>)}<section class="editor-note"><h2>Know where it lives.</h2><p>Working data is saved in this browser when storage is available. It can be cleared, does not sync, and is accessible to scripts on the same origin, including other projects at jdinkla.github.io. Keep only non-sensitive information. Export a JSON backup. Downloaded files can run offline, but file storage behavior varies by browser. <a href={withBase('/storage/')}>Read the storage guide</a>.</p></section></div></Base>
